@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FBFCFE
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #334155
  ActorBorderColor #334155
  LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
  ParticipantBorderColor #334155
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E0F2FE
}

actor User
participant "linkedin_oauth.py" as App
participant "Local callback\nlocalhost:8080" as Callback
participant "LinkedIn OAuth" as OAuth
participant "LinkedIn UserInfo" as Profile

User -> App: Run authorization command
App -> Callback: Start one-request HTTP server
App -> OAuth: Open authorization URL\nopenid profile email w_member_social w_organization_social
OAuth -> User: Show consent screen
User -> OAuth: Approve
OAuth -> Callback: Redirect with code + state
Callback -> App: Return authorization code
App -> App: Validate state
App -> OAuth: Exchange code for access token
OAuth --> App: access_token + expires_in
App -> Profile: GET /v2/userinfo
Profile --> App: sub, name, email
App -> App: Save linkedin_token.json locally
@enduml
